# Assignment 1 Flutter Project

## Overview
My Assignment 1 Flutter application, simply has two navigable screens displaying text and an image

## Requirements

Before running the project, make sure you have:

- Flutter SDK
- Dart
- Android Studio or VS code
- Emulator or simulator set up

Check Flutter installation with

flutter doctor

## Run instructions

git clone https://github.com/joshcxw/assignment1.git

Run the application through VS code or with flutter through a command line

